  "sourceTitle": "Meatballs In Spicy Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Meatballs In Spicy Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 22, 2009 - 12:21am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 lbs. ground chuck\n1 pkg. onion soup mix\n1/4 cup bread crumbs\n2 eggs\n2 tablespoons Accent\n1 bottle hot catsup\n1 (10 oz.) bottle apple currant jelly\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Meatballs: Mix ingredients together and make meatballs. Brown. 2 Heat catsup and jelly until jelly is melted. Add meatballs and cook in 350 degree oven until sauce is bubbly. Serve over rice or noodles.",
